<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani money market rates remain high.</title>
<headline>Pakistani money market rates remain high.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's overnight call money rates remained high in an inactive market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The overnight deals were struck at the level of 17.00 percent and it is believed that banks discounted approximately seven billion rupees with the State (central) Bank of Pakistan,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is expected that the rates will stay firm tomorrow,&quot; the dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
